            "line": 617,
            "text": "theorem radialProfile_hasDerivAt_time {a τ r : ℝ} (ha : 1 < a) (hτ : 0 < τ) (hr : 0 < r) :\n    HasDerivAt (fun τ => radialProfile a τ r)\n      (2 * (r ^ 2 / 2) ^ (spatialExponent a - 1) * profileJet a 1 (2 * τ / (r ^ 2 / 2))) τ"
